{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"李慧琼、陳祖光及葛珮帆開設聯合辦事處\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/STARRY-OFFICE-261108-16.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】立法會主席李慧琼聯同兩名議員陳祖光及葛珮帆於黃大仙開設聯合辦事處。</p><p>辦事處位於黃大仙竹園南邨，警務處處長周一鳴亦有出席開幕典禮。</p><p>本身來自九龍中地方選區的李慧琼致辭時提到，竹園邨長者居多，正全力爭取撥款，於邨內興建行人通道系統，便利市民。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.847421+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T09:30:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:57:00.927120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:57.892397+00:00","content_hash":"8e9227b51d7fd53aea142eef6a95f1dd7a80c81e3962c0c0c43da58831475f46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.847421+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}